---
manual: styles.click
lines: [1144, 1151]
testability: interactive
display: any
expect: fail
reason: "Lacci's Button does not declare a :click style, so the proc is dropped with an 'Unexpected non-style keyword' warning (no ledger row yet; requested)."
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @count = para "0"
  @go = button "Go", click: proc { @count.replace((@count.text.to_i + 1).to_s) }
end
----------- test code
assert_equal "0", para("@count").text, "nothing has been clicked yet"

button.trigger_click

assert_equal "1", para("@count").text, "the proc given as the :click style ran once"
